WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.850
<v Mariam Kaboré>Hello and thank you for having me. To begin, could you

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:07.600
<v Mariam Kaboré>introduce yourself and tell me how you came to work at the newspaper?

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.978
<v Adama Sawadogo>Hello. My name is Adama Sawadogo. I joined

00:00:12.978 --> 00:00:16.321
<v Adama Sawadogo>the newspaper Le Réveil (The Awakening) in 1982 in

00:00:16.321 --> 00:00:20.400
<v Adama Sawadogo>Ouagadougou as an apprentice typographer. I was 17 years old.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.500
<v Mariam Kaboré>So you learned the trade at the paper itself, from the older typographers who were already working there before you?

